WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:02.836
All I said is we should bail on the hike.

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.129
I didn’t mean us in general.

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:06.172
You don’t want to make our relationship better?

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:08.299
Our relationship is fine.

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:10.885
Schmigadoon?

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:12.595
♫ Welcome to our little town

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:13.763
I hate musicals.

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:15.473
It must be something they do for tourists.

00:00:15.473 --> 00:00:16.349
Ha ha ha!

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:17.726
Was that a leprechaun?

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:19.978
We’re in an actual musical.

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:20.979
Please god, no.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:21.938
Everybody!

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:24.107
You know musicals.

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:24.983
There’s got to be a way.

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:27.277
We are only here 'til we've found true love.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.111
What does that even mean?

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:30.280
Which of you ladies wants to cross this bridge with me?

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.906
You want to try with other people?

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:33.158
We already tried together.

00:00:34.242 --> 00:00:35.326
I want to be with you.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.287
What a beautiful couple you two make.

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:39.497
I don’t like those outsiders.

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:41.207
They need to go.

00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:43.168
Ladies, can I get a cackle?

00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:47.964
Where the men are men and the cows are cows ♫ 

00:00:47.964 --> 00:00:49.549
You have one heart.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.593
Is he the one you want to give it to?

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:53.386
I am so sorry.

00:00:54.095 --> 00:00:55.013
I love you.

00:00:55.972 --> 00:00:57.640
Have you forgotten what these sinful city folk

00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:58.433
have done to this town?

00:00:58.433 --> 00:00:59.726
They’ve made Schmigadoon better.

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:00.477
For everyone.

00:01:01.978 --> 00:01:02.979
Let’s head back home.

